# NOTHING IS EXCLUDED EXCEPT OS JUNK.
# This repo is a MIRROR of the working folder: a fresh clone must reproduce exactly what
# is on the dev machine, so build output (build.rbxl), the backup_before_* folders, the
# pet system export + zip, __pycache__ and .claude/ are all COMMITTED on purpose.
#
# If you are tempted to re-add ignores here: the build artefact and the export folders are
# ~4MB of binaries and duplicated source. That is a deliberate trade for "clone it and you
# have exactly what I have", not an oversight.
#
# The three below are per-machine files Windows/macOS create in any folder they touch.
# They are not part of anyone's work and would only ever cause pointless conflicts.
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
